  "title": "Joy to the World",
  "lyrics": [
    "Verse 1:",
    "[D]Joy to the world! [Em]The [D]Lord [A]is [D]come!",
    "Let [G]earth re[A]ceive her [D]King!",
    "Let [D]every heart prepare Him room,",
    "And [D]heav'n and nature sing,",
    "And [A]heav'n and nature sing,",
    "And [D]heav'n [G]and [D]heav'n [Em]and [D]na[A]ture [D]sing!",
    "",
    "Verse 2:",
    "[D]Joy to the world! [Em]the [D]Savio[A]r [D]reigns;",
    "Let [G]men their [A]songs em[D]ploy;",
    "While [D]field and floods, rocks, hills, and plains.",
    "Re[D]peat the sounding joy,",
    "Re[A]peat the sounding joy,",
    "Re[D]peat, r[G]epea[D]t the [Em]sou[D]ndi[A]ng jo[D]y.",
    "",
    "Verse 3:",
    "[D]He rules the world[Em] with [D]truth[A] and [D]grace",
    "And [G]makes the [A]nations [D]prove",
    "The [D]glories of His righteousness,",
    "And [D]wonders of His love,",
    "And [A]wonders of His love,",
    "And [D]wonders[G], wo[D]nders [Em]of [D]  [A]His [D]love."
  ],
  "artist": "Handel, George Frederick (1685-1759), Watts, Isaac (1674-1748), Hillsong Worship",
  "key": "D",
